STAAD SPACE ONE-BAY SPACE FRAME (Z UP)
* Four columns 3.5 m high on a 5 m x 4 m plan, beams at the top, gravity and wind.
SET Z UP
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0; 2 5 0 0; 3 5 4 0; 4 0 4 0
REPEAT ALL 1 0 0 3.5
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 5 4
5 5 6 7
8 8 5
MEMBER PROPERTY INDIAN
1 TO 4 TABLE ST ISMB250
5 TO 8 TABLE ST ISMB300
CONSTANTS
E STEEL ALL
POISSON STEEL ALL
DENSITY STEEL ALL
SUPPORTS
1 TO 4 FIXED
LOAD 1 TITLE GRAVITY AND WIND
SELFWEIGHT Z -1
MEMBER LOAD
5 TO 8 UNI GZ -12
JOINT LOAD
5 8 FX 6
PERFORM ANALYSIS
FINISH
